1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
四川辣里带麻，湖南不一样
Sichuan numbs; Hunan doesn't.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
湖南人不怕辣，是"怕不辣"
Hunanese don't fear heat — they fear none.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
这里的辣，是"鲜辣"
Here, heat means fresh heat.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
小米辣、剁椒，全用新鲜的
Bird's-eye and chopped chili, all fresh.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
辣椒炒肉，辣椒比肉多
Chili-fried pork — more chili than pork.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
剁椒鱼头，红得冒火
Fish head under a blanket of chili.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
在湖南，辣椒是一道菜
In Hunan, chili is a dish itself.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
吃得苦、霸得蛮、怕不辣
Tough, gutsy, fearless of heat.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
可全国第一，还不是湖南
Yet Hunan still isn't number one.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
那第一是谁？下集揭晓
Then who is? Revealed next.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,600
湖南和四川，谁更辣？评论区
Hunan or Sichuan — who's hotter? Comment.
